## ⚠️ Important Notes

- **API Costs**: The Claude API has usage costs. Monitor your usage!
- **Rate Limiting**: Implement rate limiting in production
- **Security**: Never expose your API key in frontend code
- **CORS**: Configure CORS properly for production

